  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05628d7c7109c665",
      "translationZh": "hexagon：matmul 与 flash-atten 可扩展性更新 ( #29974 )",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0adc484136a689dc",
      "translationZh": "hexagon：针对行拆分多核架构的 head-parallel flash_attn 分区方式",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ad971f3a8ce2edc",
      "translationZh": "在行拆分模式下，每个核心计算其对应的每一行输出分片",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a332062a7c54bb0",
      "translationZh": "MUL_MAT，但 flash_attn 此前是按 Q token 进行划分的",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26127629e53a77ce",
      "translationZh": "(平坦的 qrow 分割) 而不是按头部分割。这迫使每个核心",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33f2ef4686b789f7",
      "translationZh": "读取完整的 KV 缓存（所有 n_kv_heads），这会抵消内存优势",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f68b597f3d5d936f",
      "translationZh": "多核在 flash_attn 上的带宽收益。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "888b8d959405caa3",
      "translationZh": "将 HMX 和 HVX 的 flash_attn 内核均更改为按 KV 头进行分区",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c8a908be607d770",
      "translationZh": "当 n_kv_heads 能被 n_cores 整除时：核心 i 处理对应的头",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a88ae6aa08cde985",
      "translationZh": "专属地处理 [i*n_kv_heads/N, (i+1)*n_kv_heads/N) 范围，仅读取其",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18112f05ecf9b7c4",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存的头分片。当 n_kv_heads % n_cores != 0 时（例如具有 2 个 KV 头的 Gemma-4），回退到原始的 token-block",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f3146015bb1705e",
      "translationZh": "分片方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b218df9c997dccd1",
      "translationZh": "由 GGML_HEXAGON_FA_HEAD_SPLIT 控制（默认 1 = 开启）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ec543439cf3ea45",
      "translationZh": "该标志位被打包进现有的 is_dst_fp32 kparams 字节的第 1 位中，",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f68fce02c841b31",
      "translationZh": "以保持在 128 字节的 kernel_params blob 限制之内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a61c591e65aab7a",
      "translationZh": "在 4c 行拆分下的测量收益（PP t/s, ubatch=1024）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3bc0a412e98817e",
      "translationZh": "Gemma-4 MoE: 无变化 (MoE FFN 占主导地位，回退路径)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc4e0875dc6ee72a",
      "translationZh": "TG 保持不变 (flash_attn 仅占解码时间的极小部分",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b77a6f10ce21cbc9",
      "translationZh": "相对于每层 matmul+barrier 的成本)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d123d63dd0a12d45",
      "translationZh": "hex-fa: 清理 kern_params 和 head-split 选择",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31eb655cdd2c7e1b",
      "translationZh": "hex-fa: 在 run.py 中添加 -fa-head-split 选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "237e807789c6b15c",
      "translationZh": "hex-mdev：更新矩阵乘法求解器，以考虑行拆分场景下的工作量减少",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81f11c4481da6800",
      "translationZh": "hex-mmid：在多设备场景下实现更佳的专家工作拆分",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b2eff76c04752fa",
      "translationZh": "hex-fa：根据模型/n-hvx/上下文长度扫描更新 HMX 门控",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
